; DISPATCHER: "ACT" keyword with the WRONG arity (4 instead of 3).  Upstream's ACT arm
; demands Arity(3) (sinks.rs:1287) -> no arm matches -> panic!("unrecognized sink").
; A CompatSink fallback would instead insert (ACT g8x y 1) into the space as a literal atom.
(foo 1)
(exec 0 (, (foo $a)) (O (ACT g8x y $a)))
